                # But need to distinguish: if we are at EOF after delimiter, while loop top adds field.
                # Continue field parsing; special handling in loop: it checks i>=n and appends.
                # To avoid infinite, use flag: continue outer field loop
                # If next separator is terminator, we will parse an empty field then end.
                # Fall through to continue
                if self.i>=n:
